# The EARNWINGS core API the account page talks to.
#
# Unset, every request goes to the marketing origin and 404s — the sign-in form will
# simply say it cannot reach the API.
#
# TWO PLACES MUST AGREE OR THIS SILENTLY FAILS:
#   1. vercel.json → Content-Security-Policy → connect-src must list this origin, or
#      the browser blocks each request before it is sent. A CSP block does not surface
#      as a network error; it surfaces as nothing happening at all.
#   2. The core service's ALLOWED_ORIGINS must list THIS site's origin, or the browser
#      rejects the response for CORS.
VITE_CORE_URL=https://api.earnwings.org
